etrieves shipment (throws 404 if missing)\n- Checks if CANCELLED (throws 409 if so)\n- Transitions CREATED→CONFIRMED via immutable copy and repository save\n- Returns CONFIRMED unchanged (idempotent)\n\n**ShipmentControllerTest.kt:** Added 4 new test methods:\n1. Confirms CREATED→CONFIRMED transition and returns shipment\n2. Confirms idempotent retry of CONFIRMED shipment\n3. Confirms CANCELLED shipment rejected with 409 and SHIPMENT_CANNOT_CONFIRM error code\n4. Confirms missing shipment rejected with 404 and SHIPMENT_NOT_FOUND error code\n\nAlso added helper method `confirmShipment` to reduce test code duplication.\n\n**Unresolved findings:** None. All acceptance criteria are met, all tests pass, implementation follows existing conventions.\n\n---\n\n```\n<<PHASE:DONE>>\n```\n\nRequirement: Add POST /shipments/{shipmentId}/confirm endpoint that confirms a shipment, allowing idempotent retries, rejecting CANCELLED shipments with 409, and unknown IDs with 404.\n\nChanged:\n- ApiError.kt: Added SHIPMENT_CANNOT_CONFIRM error code for state conflict\n- ShipmentController.kt: Added confirm endpoint with status transition logic and error handling\n- ShipmentControllerTest.kt: Added 4 tests covering all confirm endpoint cases\n\nTests:\n- Confirms a created shipment transitions to CONFIRMED status\n- Confirms an already confirmed shipment succeeds without change\n- Confirms a cancelled shipment returns 409 with SHIPMENT_CANNOT_CONFIRM\n- Confirms a non-existent shipment returns 404 with SHIPMENT_NOT_FOUND\n\nVerification: Ran `./mvnw test` from sample-service/ — BUILD SUCCESS with all 17 tests passing (5 existing + 4 new confirm tests + others)\n\nNot done: Nothing. All acceptance criteria satisfied, build passes, tests pass, no new dependencies, no unrelated changes."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":8,"cache_creation_input_tokens":3402,"cache_read_input_tokens":21327,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_in